n_text_map\n[1]: 开心，兴奋\n[2]: 冷漠，平静\n[3]: 愤怒，尖叫\n注：此处本质是通过大语言模型来理解，所以可以较为自由地使用自然语言描述。\n\n\n\nemotion_alpha_map\n[1]: 0.2\n[2]: 1.0\n[2]: 1.5\n\nuse_emo_text_map, use_random_map\n[1]: true\n[2]: false\n{3}: true\n说明: 不需要严格输入 True 或 False。代码被设计为可以识别多种常用词：\n表示“是” (True): true, yes, on, 1 (不区分大小写)\n表示“否” (False): 除了上面列出的词以外的任何内容，\n例如 false, no, off, 0，或者干脆不写这一行。\n\nemotion_vector_map\n[1]: [0.1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.9]\n[2]: [0.1, 0.2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.9]\n[3]: [0.1, 0, 0, 0, 0.5, 0, 0, 0.9]\n这8个数字分别对应 [高兴, 愤怒, 悲伤, 恐惧, 反感, 低落, 惊讶, 自然] 的强度。\n"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":60,"type":"IndexTTS2_Dialogue_Studio","pos":[154.75863647460938,374.77606201171875],"size":[400,790],"flags":{},"order":2,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"speaker_map","name":"speaker_map","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"speaker_map"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"script","name":"script","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"script"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"subtitle_max_length","name":"subtitle_max_length","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"subtitle_max_length"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"silence_duration","name":"silence_duration","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"silence_duration"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"precision","name":"precision","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"precision"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"model_unload_strategy","name":"model_unload_strategy","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"model_unload_strategy"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"top_k","name":"top_k","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"top_k"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"top_p","name":"top_p","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"top_p"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"temperature","name":"temperature","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"temperature"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"num_beams","name":"num_beams","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"num_beams"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"repetition_penalty","name":"repetition_penalty","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"repetition_penalty"},"link":null},{"localize